tatami-adbgen(8)

# NAME

tatami adbgen - generate v3 files from text representation

# SYNOPSIS

*tatami adbgen* [<_options_>...]

# DESCRIPTION

*tatami adbgen* takes in *tatami-adbdump*(8) output and convert it back to the
corresponding binary format.

# SEE ALSO

*tatami-adbdump*(8), *tatami-package*(5), *tatami-v3*(5)
